Subject: [candle] quantized-dtypes-and-buffers

  The three i-quant dtypes a GGUF reader must name and size but has no codec for, the Metal buffer accessors oscar reaches quantized weights through, a weight quantised on the host placed once with no device storage made first, and the GGUF reader's staging as an anonymous mapping rather than a malloc block the allocator would keep dirty.

Applies to: 0.10.2
Files: 4

